{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The undead never stop coming\u2026 but neither do you!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mow down relentless hordes of zombies with wild weapons, devastating skills, and game breaking synergies in this fast-paced bullet heaven survival game crafted by a solo dev. Whether playing alone or teaming up in couch co-op, every run is chaotic, challenging, and full of surprises.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>10 Survivors - 60 Skins</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>10 unique heroes</strong>\u00a0and collect\u00a0<strong>over 60 skins</strong> to customize your survivor.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>60+ Skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize every run based on your game style, you can find anything you want! from critical chance builds, to lifesteal, summoning and more! Combine <strong>28+ passive skills</strong> with powerful synergies to create game-breaking builds and unleash carnage your own way. Every run is different!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2 Players Couch Co-op Chaos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Double the firepower, double the mayhem! <strong>Team up in local couch co-op</strong> and fight side by side in the ultimate test of survival. Work together to create devastating builds, cover each other\u2019s backs, and see if you can outlast the swarm!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>5 Unique Scenarios</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five unique scenarios with their own mechanics, a gripping story on surviving the apocalypse.<strong> </strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>30 Collectibles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover 30 unique collectibles that reveal the events leading up to and during the apocalypse. Each one adds a piece to the puzzle of what really happened.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face relentless <strong>hordes of Zs</strong>, but beware the <strong>Alpha Zs</strong>: <br> <br><strong>Sneaky</strong> \u2013 Silent but deadly. <br><strong>Fatty</strong> \u2013 Slow, but explosive! <br><strong>Fast</strong> \u2013 Quick and relentless. <br><strong>Tanky</strong> \u2013 Tough and hard to take down.  <br><strong>Goliath</strong> \u2013 A force of nature that few can defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635000/extras/7eabaeb091f680208c9fe29ff1b5739f.avif?t=1761231861\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635000/extras_big/7eabaeb091f680208c9fe29ff1b5739f.avif?t=1761231861 width=800 height=446 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"SUPERIOR PLAYS","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3635000/7a3174989c09ea7ea44d3ba82404dc73a571d0c8.jpg"},{"name":"GODLY SKILLS","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3635000/b925c86b99f103e9914287800b4ecef8bbff3d18.jpg"},{"name":"BIG GAME HUNTER","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3635000/1c891197b30c9abc21389211f191d95befa22f3f.jpg"},{"name":"PERFECTION","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3635000/a4300a01cd994f069112bebdadc01b7f1143cda0.jpg"},{"name":"Z WARRIOR","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3635000/619aca1c58bdd9f65b8bb63b2d17cc789c0188f4.jpg"},{"name":"SHIFU","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3635000/5177a71246bb7a47ba52d7f9854bc82cca9f0d38.jpg"},{"name":"A LITTLE BIT OF EVERYTHING","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3635000/884f664387cbc73a5a7338114e98cb6c5cce66a3.jpg"},{"name":"FULL CAST","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3635000/965e009d40